version 4.6
game MW

ui_text This scripts makes specific Challenge Series events compatible with Bartender.
ui_text
ui_text Bartender's "Advanced" feature set makes the game read the "ForceHeatLevel"
ui_text and "MaxHeatLevel" parameters of Challenge Series events; however, some
ui_text of them rely on the vanilla game's hard-coded behaviour and therefore
ui_text require minor parameter adjustments to work as intended with this fix.
ui_text
ui_text You can safely ignore any errors this script might produce.

add_field gameplay race_bin_challenge_tollbooth/challenge_burgerking ForceHeatLevel
update_field gameplay race_bin_challenge_tollbooth/challenge_burgerking ForceHeatLevel 5

add_field gameplay race_bin_challenge_tollbooth/challenge_burgerking UseWorldHeat
update_field gameplay race_bin_challenge_tollbooth/challenge_burgerking UseWorldHeat True

add_field gameplay race_bin_challenge_tollbooth/challenge_tollbooth_03 MaxHeatLevel
update_field gameplay race_bin_challenge_tollbooth/challenge_tollbooth_03 MaxHeatLevel 5